# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository, whatever platform commits
# them. `.prettierrc` pins `endOfLine: "lf"`, so without this rule a Windows
# checkout stores CRLF and `pnpm format:check` reports every file as unformatted
# — the gate would be unusable on exactly the machines that need it most.
#
# `text=auto` lets git keep detecting binary content on its own; the font entries
# below are stated explicitly because they are the only binary assets in the tree
# and a misdetection there would corrupt the payloads.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
